Recommends: ydotool, wl-clipboard
Description: Local-only Linux dictation using faster-whisper
 System tray dictation application that captures audio via push-to-talk,
 transcribes speech using OpenAI Whisper (GPU-accelerated via CUDA),
 applies domain-specific vocabulary corrections and punctuation commands,
 and injects text at the cursor position.
 .
 All processing is entirely local. No data leaves the device.
 NVIDIA GPU with CUDA 12+ drivers required for GPU acceleration.
